{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: LLM基础MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Prompt Engineering 的核心技巧有哪些？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LLM基础与Prompt工程\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/LLM基础\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"Prompt Engineering 的核心技巧有哪些？\" dir=\"auto\">Prompt Engineering 的核心技巧有哪些？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Prompt Engineering 有哪些核心技巧？如何系统性地优化 Prompt？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、核心技巧矩阵</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技巧</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>零样本提示</strong></td>\n<td>直接下达清晰指令</td>\n<td>简单任务</td>\n<td>\"用一句话解释量子计算\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>少样本提示 (Few-shot)</strong></td>\n<td>提供范例让模型模仿</td>\n<td>格式严格、专业任务</td>\n<td>提供 2-3 个输入-输出对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>思维链 (CoT)</strong></td>\n<td>要求展示推理步骤</td>\n<td>数学、逻辑推理</td>\n<td>\"让我们一步步思考\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>自洽性</strong></td>\n<td>多次推理投票选共识</td>\n<td>减少随机错误</td>\n<td>多次采样取最一致答案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>思维树 (ToT)</strong></td>\n<td>多分支探索择优</td>\n<td>创意、规划</td>\n<td>\"提出三种方案并评估\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>反思机制</strong></td>\n<td>自我审查修正</td>\n<td>高质量要求</td>\n<td>\"检查并改进你的回答\"</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、Prompt 结构最佳实践</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">OPTIMAL_PROMPT_STRUCTURE <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n# 1. 角色定义（放在最前面 - Lost in the Middle 效应）\n你是一位资深{role}，擅长{skills}。\n\n# 2. 任务描述\n请完成以下任务：{task_description}\n\n# 3. 输入数据\n## 用户问题\n{user_query}\n\n## 参考资料\n{retrieved_context}\n\n# 4. 约束条件（放在最后强化）\n- 只能使用参考资料中的信息\n- 不确定的内容说\"无法确认\"\n- 回答控制在 200 字以内\n- 输出 JSON 格式\n\n# 5. 输出格式示例（Few-shot）\n## 示例\n输入：...\n输出：{...}\n\"\"\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、Lost in the Middle 效应</strong></p>\n<blockquote dir=\"auto\">\n<p>LLM 对上下文窗口中间位置的信息关注度最低，开头和结尾关注度高。</p>\n<p>应对策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">核心指令放开头（System Prompt 最前面）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">关键约束放结尾</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">避免在 Prompt 中间放关键信息</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四、Prompt 评估方法</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">PromptEvaluator</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"工业级 Prompt 评估\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">evaluate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> test_cases<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">case</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> test_cases<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            output <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">format</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">**</span><span class=\"token keyword\">case</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">input</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            results<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"accuracy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_score_accuracy<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>output<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">case</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>expected<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"format_adherence\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_check_format<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>output<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">case</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">format</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"token_count\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_count_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>output<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"consistency\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_check_consistency<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">case</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">input</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"avg_accuracy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">sum</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>r<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"accuracy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> r <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"format_compliance\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">sum</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>r<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"format_adherence\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> r <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"avg_tokens\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">sum</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>r<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"token_count\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> r <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">ab_test</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> prompt_a<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> prompt_b<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> test_cases<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"A/B 对比两个 Prompt\"\"\"</span>\n        score_a <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt_a<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> test_cases<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        score_b <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt_b<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> test_cases<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 重点关注：哪些 case 从对变错（新问题）</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 哪些 case 从错变对（修复了什么）</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"A\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> score_a<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"avg_accuracy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> score_b<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"avg_accuracy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"B\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"Prompt 优化有什么陷阱？\"</strong> — 在测试集上过拟合、忽视 token 成本、没有系统评估</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"Few-shot 给多少个示例合适？\"</strong> — 通常 2-4 个，质量比数量重要。要给正反例</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}